```
| tstats summariesonly=false allow_old_summaries=true
    count min(_time) as FirstSeen max(_time) as LastSeen values(Processes.process) as SampleCommands
    from datamodel=Endpoint.Processes
    where Processes.parent_process_name IN ("<parent1>", "<parent2>")
      AND Processes.process_name IN ("<child1>", "<child2>")
    by Processes.dest Processes.parent_process_name Processes.process_name
| rename "Processes.*" as "*"
``` Tuning: exclusions for known-good activity go here ```
| convert ctime(FirstSeen) ctime(LastSeen)
| sort 0 FirstSeen
